{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "编写属于你自己的账单小组件",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1881",
      "props": {
        "anchor": "编写属于你自己的账单小组件",
        "level": 1
      },
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Cent 1.5引入了全新的 Widget 系统，允许你用一小段 JavaScript 脚本读取账本数据、渲染轻量 UI，并通过配置表单把组件参数暴露给最终用户。本文面向开发者和高级用户，介绍 Widget 能做什么、权限与数据模型、如何编写最小可运行示例，以及在 Cent 编辑器里调试与发布的实用步骤。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1882",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "为什么要用 Widget？",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1883",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "可视化你关心的统计：自定义支出聚合、分类排行、预算进度等。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1885",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "轻量而安全：DSL 渲染（",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Flex",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Text",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Container",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 等）避免直接操作 DOM，执行环境做了权限与 API 限制。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1887",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "用户可配置：通过 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "export const config",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 自动生成表单，让非开发者也能调整展示参数。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1889",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "核心概念速览",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1890",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "元数据与权限：通过文件头部的 JSDoc 注释声明 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "@widget-api",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "@name",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 与 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "@permissions",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，未声明的权限在运行时将不会注入对应数据。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1892",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "config",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "：导出对象，用于定义配置表单（支持 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "text",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "number",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "date",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "select",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "）。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1894",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "渲染函数：脚本必须默认导出一个 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "async",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 函数，签名为 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "async (context) => DSL",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，接收 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.data",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.settings",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.env",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1896",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "DSL：使用 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Flex",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Text",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "、",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Container",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 等链式 API 返回 UI 描述，由 Cent 内部渲染为真实 React 组件。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1898",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "更多技术细节与权限表请参见仓库内的规范：",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "src/components/widget/core/WIDGET_API.md",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://github.com/glink25/Cent/blob/main/src/components/widget/core/WIDGET_API.md",
          "type": "link"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1899",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "最小可运行示例",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 下面的示例展示了一个简单的“账单总额”组件：它声明了 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "billing",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 权限、定义了一个可配置的标题，并在渲染函数中从 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.data.billing",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 计算总额。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1900",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "/**\n * @widget-api 1.0\n * @name 账单总额（示例）\n * @permissions billing\n */\n\nexport const config = {\n  title: { type: 'text', label: '标题', default: '我的账单总额' },\n  startDate: { type: 'date', label: '开始日期' }\n};\n\nexport default async ({ data, settings, env }) => {\n  const bills = (data && data.billing) || [];\n  const start = settings.startDate ? new Date(settings.startDate) : null;\n  const filtered = start ? bills.filter(b => new Date(b.time) >= start) : bills;\n  const total = filtered.reduce((s, b) => s + (b.amount || 0), 0);\n\n  return Flex(\n    Text(settings.title || '账单总额').fontSize(16).bold(),\n    Text('总金额：' + total).fontSize(14).color('#333')\n  ).direction('column').gap(8);\n};\n",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1901",
      "props": {
        "language": "javascript"
      },
      "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "如何在 Cent 编辑器中调试（3 步）",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1902",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "打开 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "设置 → Widget 设置",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "，点击“新增 Widget”或编辑已有 Widget，粘贴上面的代码。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1904",
      "props": {
        "start": 1
      },
      "type": "numberedListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "在编辑器右侧的权限栏勾选 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "billing",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（若编辑器提示需要），在表单区填写 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "startDate",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 或保留默认值。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1906",
      "props": {
        "start": 2
      },
      "type": "numberedListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "观察预览区，编辑器会在你修改后约 500ms 防抖后自动运行并更新预览；若出错，编辑器会显示错误信息与堆栈，方便定位。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1908",
      "props": {
        "start": 3
      },
      "type": "numberedListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "关于权限与数据",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " Widget 的数据注入严格根据头部注释声明的权限提供。例如声明 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "@permissions billing, category",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 将允许你的脚本通过 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.data.billing",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 与 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.data.categories",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 访问账单与分类数据。出于安全与稳定性考虑，运行时会剥离潜在危险的全局 API（如 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "eval",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "Function",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " / 网络套接字）。详情见规范文档： ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "styles": {},
              "text": "src/components/widget/core/WIDGET_API.md",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "href": "https://github.com/glink25/Cent/blob/main/src/components/widget/core/WIDGET_API.md",
          "type": "link"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1909",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "实用提示与常见坑",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1910",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "保持渲染函数为纯函数：不要在运行时修改外部状态或调用长时阻塞的网络请求（渲染超时为 2000ms）。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1912",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "使用 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "settings",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 提供灵活性：尽量将可变参数放在 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "config",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 中，让最终用户能通过表单调整行为。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1914",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "对数据做稳健判断：",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "context.data",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 中的字段可能为 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "undefined",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（未授权），请使用默认值以避免运行时错误。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1916",
      "props": {},
      "type": "bulletListItem"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "text": "发布与在首页展示",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": " 编辑器中保存并启用 ",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "showInHome",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "（或在 Widget 列表中切换开关），已启用的 Widget 会出现在首页（",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {
            "code": true
          },
          "text": "src/pages/home/index.tsx",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "），以横向滑动容器的形式显示，用户可通过滑动或切换查看多个 Widget。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1917",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "styles": {},
          "text": "Widget API 为 Cent 提供了一条平衡灵活性与安全性的可扩展路径：开发者可以用熟悉的 JavaScript 定制数据展示，而普通用户能通过自动生成的表单调整参数并实时预览效果。",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "id": "post_f669dcf8f9c355f90dbf7976_b1918",
      "props": {},
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
